shotload2     Sounds/rs_weapon/vr_shotgun/SHOTLOAD2.ogg

// --- Super Shotgun ---
// shotgun2.wav was previously misplaced inside the Shotgun's folder --
// this is genuinely the SuperShotgun's fire sound, moved to its own
// folder. Reload uses built-in GZDoom actions (A_OpenShotgun2/
